1
00:02:08,467 --> 00:02:09,967
你们觉得他们要带我们去哪儿?
Where do you think they're taking us?

2
00:02:10,425 --> 00:02:12,092
我猜是监狱
I'm gonna go with jail.

3
00:02:12,842 --> 00:02:16,467
真是难以置信 那个鱼竿男居然那么轻易就把我们盘了!
I still can't believe that fishing pole guy took us out like it was nothing!

4
00:02:16,758 --> 00:02:18,008
欢迎来到擎天
Welcome to Atlas.

5
00:02:18,217 --> 00:02:20,967
那些可是埃隆伍德的金牌特工
Those were Ironwood's Ace Operatives.

6
00:02:21,425 --> 00:02:22,300
嗯?
Hmm?

7
00:02:22,842 --> 00:02:24,758
你们碰到了金牌特工?
You guys had a run-in with the Ace-Ops?

8
00:02:25,133 --> 00:02:27,633
埃隆伍德一定是跟你们有血海深仇吧
Ironwood must really have a bone to pick with you.

9
00:02:29,258 --> 00:02:30,925
他们也没什么了不起的
They're not that big of a deal.

10
00:02:31,717 --> 00:02:33,092
没什么了不起的?
Not that big of a deal?

11
00:02:33,592 --> 00:02:36,842
金牌特工可是猎人里精英中的精英
The Ace-Ops are the elite-of-elite military Huntsmen.

12
00:02:37,217 --> 00:02:40,467
同时也是埃隆伍德的私人猎犬
And Ironwood's personal attack dogs.

13
00:02:41,050 --> 00:02:42,175
所以你也被他们逮住了 是吧?
So they got you too, huh?

14
00:02:42,342 --> 00:02:43,050
切!
Pfft!

15
00:02:43,383 --> 00:02:45,633
本大爷才不会被他们抓到!
I wouldn't let myself get caught by them!

16
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:50,217
我被捕是因为 我一直在反对擎天对曼特城的剥削
I'm here because I've been speaking out against Atlas' exploitation of Mantle.

17
00:02:50,258 --> 00:02:52,842
而埃隆伍德将军想让我闭嘴!
And General Ironwood is trying to silence me!

18
00:02:53,383 --> 00:02:54,842
你向一架飞船扔了块砖!
You threw a brick at a ship!

19
00:02:55,008 --> 00:02:57,967
为了让大家注意我们的斗争 这也是值得的!
It's worth it if it gets people talking about our cause!

20
00:03:00,050 --> 00:03:01,217
我们的斗争?
Our cause?

21
00:03:01,342 --> 00:03:04,550
对 为了让曼特城市民获得更好的待遇而战!
Yes, the fight for better conditions in Mantle!

22
00:03:04,717 --> 00:03:09,258
由魅力无限 才华横溢 美丽动人的罗宾·修
Lead by the charismatic, talented, lovely, Robyn Hill

23
00:03:09,383 --> 00:03:11,592
和她愉快的小猎女们带领着!
and her Happy Huntresses!

24
00:03:12,050 --> 00:03:16,133
她们都是擎天学院优秀毕业生 原本可以加入军队的
They were all top Atlas Academy graduates, who could've signed up for the military.

25
00:03:16,217 --> 00:03:19,008
但罗宾和她的猎人们却决定留在曼特城
But Robyn and the Huntresses chose to stay in Mantle.

26
00:03:19,133 --> 00:03:21,633
她正在竞选王国议会的席位
She's gunning for a seat on the kingdom's council,

27
00:03:21,675 --> 00:03:23,050
当她成为议员后
and when she gets it,

28
00:03:23,092 --> 00:03:25,800
她将会亲手终结埃隆伍德的暴政
she's gonna put an end to Ironwood's tyranny.

29
00:03:26,508 --> 00:03:28,133
愉快的小猎女们?
Happy Huntresses?

30
00:03:28,175 --> 00:03:29,592
她们真的就叫这个吗?
Is that their real name?

31
00:03:29,633 --> 00:03:31,717
暴政是不是也有点太夸张了?
Don't you think tyranny's a little dramatic?

32
00:03:34,758 --> 00:03:37,258
雪倪家的大小姐倒是说得轻松
Easy to say for a Schnee heiress

33
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:39,258
毕竟您一直舒舒服服地在擎天生活
living comfortably up in Atlas.

34
00:03:41,883 --> 00:03:42,967
已经是过去式了
Not anymore.

35
00:03:53,383 --> 00:03:56,008
哇 这里太美了!
Whoa, it's gorgeous up here!

36
00:03:57,008 --> 00:03:58,217
可别被表象骗了
Don't let that fool you.

37
00:04:03,008 --> 00:04:04,842
这里可不是警察局啊
This isn't the police station.

38
00:04:06,383 --> 00:04:08,675
这是擎天学院
It's Atlas Academy.

39
00:04:33,967 --> 00:04:36,050
我猜我们还是能见到将军的
I guess we will be seeing the General.

40
00:04:37,217 --> 00:04:38,883
也不知道到底是好是坏
For better or worse.

41
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:44,800
我们要怎么做?
So what do we do?

42
00:04:46,383 --> 00:04:47,675
我也不知道
I don't know yet.

43
00:04:47,842 --> 00:04:49,842
但我们一定要注意我们的一言一行
But we should be careful with what we say.

44
00:04:55,883 --> 00:04:57,217
Ruby 听你指挥
We'll follow your lead, Ruby.

45
00:05:15,383 --> 00:05:18,758
我真的不想再去参加那议会的会议了...
I swear if I have to sit through one more council meeting like that......

46
00:05:24,550 --> 00:05:25,300
温特
Winter.

47
00:05:28,675 --> 00:05:31,383
有谁能高抬贵手解决一下这玩意儿吗?
Anyone wanna give us a hand with these?

48
00:05:34,008 --> 00:05:37,300
你们有十秒的时间把那些取下来 否则我就要动手了
You have 10 seconds to take those off, before I start hurting you.

49
00:05:39,008 --> 00:05:39,675
蛤?
Huh?

50
00:05:40,842 --> 00:05:41,258
对不起!
Sorry!

51
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:41,758
让小的们来帮您!
Please let us help you!

52
00:05:41,925 --> 00:05:42,550
原谅小的吧!
Forgive us!

53
00:05:45,258 --> 00:05:47,008
请进
Please, come in.

54
00:05:49,717 --> 00:05:51,342
很高兴能见到你们所有人
It is so good to see all of you.

55
00:05:52,508 --> 00:05:55,092
我们被接待的方式倒跟您说的感觉完全不同
Our reception didn't really convey that.

56
00:05:58,175 --> 00:06:00,758
对于我下属处理你们的手法 我表示由衷的抱歉
I sincerely regret how you were treated by my team.

57
00:06:01,967 --> 00:06:03,883
当有来路不明的飞船进入我们的领空时
When a rogue airship entered our airspace,

58
00:06:04,008 --> 00:06:06,717
一些警报会被触发
it raised some red flags.

59
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:08,717
我们当时认为那艘飞船是被偷来的
We assumed the ship was stolen.

60
00:06:09,175 --> 00:06:09,883
偷来的?
Stolen?

61
00:06:12,133 --> 00:06:13,842
好吧 的确是偷来的
Okay yeah, it was stolen.

62
00:06:15,342 --> 00:06:18,133
你们偷了一艘擎天的飞船?
You stole an Atlas airship?

63
00:06:19,175 --> 00:06:20,758
你到底在想什么?
What were you thinking?

64
00:06:20,967 --> 00:06:22,258
你们很可能会被击落!
You might've been shot down!

65
00:06:22,425 --> 00:06:24,633
你怎么能这么不负责任--
How unbelievably irresponsi--

66
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:27,425
对不起 让你担心了
I'm sorry I worried you.

67
00:06:28,342 --> 00:06:30,383
但我们别无选择
But we did what we had to do.

68
00:06:31,425 --> 00:06:32,050
我..

69
00:06:35,342 --> 00:06:37,092
我想我能理解
I suppose I understand.

70
00:06:38,758 --> 00:06:43,050
但我不敢相信 你居然默许他们做这种事 克罗!
But I cannot believe that you allowed this to happen, Qrow!

71
00:06:43,342 --> 00:06:46,758
你自己去试试阻止这帮心意已决的熊孩子啊
You try stoppin' these kids when they have their mind set on something.

72
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:48,467
说起来
Speaking of which.

73
00:06:49,967 --> 00:06:52,717
我们有些重要信息需要告诉你..
We have some important information for you that's...

74
00:06:53,258 --> 00:06:54,383
机密的那种
confidential.

75
00:06:55,217 --> 00:06:57,175
哦 是关于圣物的消息吗?
Oh, is it about the Relics?

76
00:06:57,217 --> 00:06:59,175
还是关于冬之少女的呢?
Or perhaps the Winter Maiden?

77
00:07:01,258 --> 00:07:02,425
你跟她们说了?!
You told them?!

78
00:07:03,592 --> 00:07:04,050
呵
Hmm.

79
00:07:10,050 --> 00:07:12,050
你真的以为 你们是唯一一群
Did you really think you were the only one

80
00:07:12,092 --> 00:07:14,050
在信标陷落后改变了原计划的人吗?
who got to work on a new plan after Beacon?

81
00:07:15,008 --> 00:07:18,300
奥兹平不在后 我需要一队我自己能够信任的人
With Ozpin gone I needed my own team of people I could trust.

82
00:07:19,133 --> 00:07:20,633
所以 我告诉她们了
So yes, I told them.

83
00:07:21,508 --> 00:07:22,717
也告诉了我的金牌特工
The Ace-Ops too.

84
00:07:23,883 --> 00:07:26,883
因此 我很庆幸你们把它带来了
Which is why I'm so glad you're here with this.

85
00:07:28,633 --> 00:07:33,300
到现在为止 我曾一直以为要扭转对塞伦的劣势是不可能的事
Until now, I believed it was impossible to truly turn the tide against Salem.

86
00:07:34,050 --> 00:07:35,383
虽然奥兹阻挡了她的步伐
Oz has pushed herback.

87
00:07:35,550 --> 00:07:37,008
让她无法获胜
He's kept victory out of her claws

88
00:07:37,050 --> 00:07:39,008
但她会不断卷土重来
but she will keep returning.

89
00:07:39,050 --> 00:07:41,008
一次比一次强
Stronger and stronger.

90
00:07:43,842 --> 00:07:45,133
除非我们能毁灭她
Unless we destroy her.

91
00:07:49,633 --> 00:07:52,050
但 擎天圣物呢?
But, what about the Atlas Relic?

92
00:07:52,467 --> 00:07:53,758
你是说创造之杖吗?
You mean the Staff of Creation?

93
00:07:53,967 --> 00:07:55,592
它在宝库里 非常安全!
It's safe inside the Vault!

94
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,925
冬之少女呢?
And the Winter Maiden?

95
00:07:56,967 --> 00:07:59,758
她处境很安全 状态也很稳定
She is secure and in stable condition.

96
00:08:00,133 --> 00:08:01,758
状态很稳定 那是什么--
Stable condition, what does than

97
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:04,300
呃 她其实不能算是个少女了
She's uh, not exactly a spring chicken.

98
00:08:09,883 --> 00:08:11,550
我知道这看起来很糟
I know how this all looks.

99
00:08:11,883 --> 00:08:13,133
例如召回我的军队?
Recalling my military?

100
00:08:13,425 --> 00:08:14,467
例如尘晶禁运?
The embargo?

101
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:17,800
乍看之下我的确不是现在最值得信任的人
I probably don't seem the most trustworthy right now.

102
00:08:18,342 --> 00:08:19,425
那为什么还要继续?
Then why continue it?

103
00:08:19,550 --> 00:08:21,217
曼特城的人民现在非常痛苦!
The people of Mantle are hurting!

104
00:08:21,467 --> 00:08:24,175
我需要确保塞伦无法入侵擎天
I needed to ensure Salem couldn't infiltrate Atlas.

105
00:08:24,425 --> 00:08:26,342
所以我需要我的军队留守在这
And I wanted my military here.

106
00:08:26,633 --> 00:08:27,592
保护我的人民
Protecting my people.

107
00:08:27,883 --> 00:08:29,342
但这并不是在保护他们!
But it's not protecting them!

108
00:08:29,467 --> 00:08:30,925
还让所有人都讨厌你了
It's making everyone hate you.

109
00:08:33,633 --> 00:08:35,217
这是我愿意付出的代价
It's a price I'm willing to pay.

110
00:08:39,300 --> 00:08:42,842
正如你们被信任着 所以你们得知了塞伦的存在一样
Just as you all have been entrusted with the knowledge of Salem's existence,

111
00:08:42,883 --> 00:08:44,800
我需要你们信任我
I need you all to trust me.

112
00:08:45,758 --> 00:08:46,842
我有个计划
I have a plan.

113
00:08:49,300 --> 00:08:51,300
奥兹平认为对抗塞伦最好的办法
Ozpin believed the best way to fight Salem

114
00:08:51,342 --> 00:08:52,425
就是暗中行动
was to do so in secret.

115
00:08:52,717 --> 00:08:54,508
至于那究竟是对是错
Whether that was the right choice or not

116
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:55,967
不该由我来下定论
isn't for me to say.

117
00:08:56,008 --> 00:08:58,383
但我们发现 我们现在需要
But we find ourselves in the position of needing,

118
00:08:58,425 --> 00:09:00,008
一种新的手段
well, a new approach.

119
00:09:00,175 --> 00:09:01,800
那你有什么建议?
And what do you suggest?

120
00:09:06,675 --> 00:09:09,467
这是阿米特竞技场
That's Amity Colosseum.

121
00:09:09,508 --> 00:09:11,425
举办维特节的地方?
Where the Vytal Festival is held?

122
00:09:11,467 --> 00:09:13,675
确实 当信标陨落
Indeed. When Beacon fell

123
00:09:13,717 --> 00:09:16,383
树不子的人们无法再互相联络时
and everyone on Remnant lost contact with one another,

124
00:09:16,717 --> 00:09:18,633
我意识到我们现有的系统已经过时了
I knew our current system was outdated.

125
00:09:18,842 --> 00:09:21,758
阿米特竞技场是为了实现国际团结而建造的
Amity was built to bring the nations together.

126
00:09:22,258 --> 00:09:24,342
而它会再次实现这个目的
And it will serve that purpose once again.

127
00:09:32,425 --> 00:09:33,467
这不是挺好吗
Isn't it great?

128
00:09:33,508 --> 00:09:36,175
我们不只是要替代信标塔
We're not going to just replace Beacon Tower.

129
00:09:36,217 --> 00:09:39,175
如果在阿米特竞技场上造一座新的通讯塔
Building a new tower ontop of Amity Colosseum

130
00:09:39,217 --> 00:09:41,925
就能够重建全球通讯!
will re-establish global communications!

131
00:09:42,092 --> 00:09:44,300
我们的科学家认为 把通讯塔送入大气层高处
By launching the tower high into the atmosphere,

132
00:09:44,342 --> 00:09:46,842
就能让它成为某种
our scientists believe we can create a sort-of

133
00:09:46,883 --> 00:09:49,508
卫星 戮兽触及不到
satellite -- out of reach of the Grimm,

134
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:52,133
而且就算我们又损失一座塔
and capable of maintaining global communications

135
00:09:52,175 --> 00:09:54,592
也能继续维持全球通讯
even if we were to lose another tower.

136
00:09:56,008 --> 00:09:57,508
那确实挺好
That is great.

137
00:09:57,717 --> 00:10:02,133
詹姆斯 你不需要动用整支军队来完成这个计划
James, you don't need the entire military for this.

138
00:10:03,925 --> 00:10:05,175
在下一阶段 我会需要的
I will for the next part.

139
00:10:05,883 --> 00:10:08,342
等我告诉人们塞伦的事
Where I finally tell the people about Salem.

140
00:10:15,758 --> 00:10:19,342
所以这就是你把部队召回的原因
Huh, so that's why you withdrew your troops,

141
00:10:19,717 --> 00:10:22,342
来应对擎天将会爆发的恐慌
to handle the panic that will break out in Atlas.

142
00:10:22,633 --> 00:10:25,092
是的 恐慌是无法避免的
Yes, panic is inevitable.

143
00:10:25,383 --> 00:10:27,008
而且恐慌会带来戮兽
And panic brings Grimm.

144
00:10:27,050 --> 00:10:28,717
但我们相信我们已经准备好了
But I believe we are ready.

145
00:10:29,050 --> 00:10:31,217
一旦擎天准备好开战
Once Atlas has come to grips with the fight ahead,

146
00:10:31,258 --> 00:10:35,092
我会用阿米特通讯塔来通告全世界
use Amity Tower to spread the message to all of Remnant.

147
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:37,133
但一切都会崩溃的!
But everything will fall apart!

148
00:10:37,175 --> 00:10:38,758
戮兽会到处都是的!
Grimm will be everywhere!

149
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:42,675
没错 但擎天愿意并准备好提供协助了
You're right, but Atlas is willing and prepared to assist.

150
00:10:42,883 --> 00:10:46,550
向世界掩饰真相 只会害死所有人
Trying to hide the truth from the world will eventually kill us all.

151
00:10:53,883 --> 00:10:58,383
奥兹尽其一生 很多人生 来保住这个秘密
LOz spent his whole life, many lives, keeping this secret.

152
00:10:59,467 --> 00:11:02,925
我知道 但自从信标后 世道变了
I know. But since Beacon, things have changed.

153
00:11:03,383 --> 00:11:04,717
他已经不在这指引我们了
Without him here to guide us,

154
00:11:04,758 --> 00:11:06,717
我只能靠自己的判断
all I can do is use my best judgment.

155
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:12,508
怎么?
What is it?

156
00:11:14,133 --> 00:11:17,508
其实 奥兹并没有完全消失
Actually, Oz isn't completely gone.

157
00:11:18,883 --> 00:11:23,550
呃 这位是奥斯卡 他是新的奥兹平
Uh, Oscar here is... He's the next Ozpin.

158
00:11:25,175 --> 00:11:26,133
奥兹
Oz?

159
00:11:27,383 --> 00:11:29,050
我真高兴你还在!
I am so glad you're here!

160
00:11:29,092 --> 00:11:29,967
我还以为你
I didn't think you --

161
00:11:30,008 --> 00:11:32,008
不完全是 他有点
Not quite. He's kind of,

162
00:11:32,050 --> 00:11:35,342
暂时不在线
um, gone at the moment.

163
00:11:37,592 --> 00:11:39,758
这不正常 他怎么会
That's not normal.How did he --

164
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:40,758
我们不知道!
We don't know!

165
00:11:42,967 --> 00:11:45,092
我们遭遇了一场火车事故
We were in a train crash,

166
00:11:45,133 --> 00:11:47,425
然后从那时起
and ever since, well,

167
00:11:47,842 --> 00:11:49,842
奥兹突然就不在了
suddenly Oz wasn't there anymore.

168
00:11:53,175 --> 00:11:54,883
这真是迄今最糟的消息
That's the worst news yet.

169
00:11:56,217 --> 00:11:58,342
你们有通过他了解关于圣物的事吗?
Did you learn anything from him about the Relics before?

170
00:11:58,383 --> 00:12:01,383
他告诉我们 提灯能回答三个问题
He told us the lamp can answer three questions.

171
00:12:02,175 --> 00:12:04,883
但所有问题都已经被问掉了
But, all the questions were used up already.

172
00:12:08,842 --> 00:12:10,342
也是
Right, right.

173
00:12:13,967 --> 00:12:15,467
奥兹平也告诉我们了
Ozpin told us that too.

174
00:12:15,883 --> 00:12:17,675
很久以前
Once upon a time...

175
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:21,842
至少我们还有你 奥斯卡
At least we have you Oscar.

176
00:12:21,967 --> 00:12:23,425
你在擎天会很安全
You're safe here in Atlas.

177
00:12:23,925 --> 00:12:26,383
也许我们能一起搞清楚要怎么带回奥兹平
Maybe together we can figure out how to bring Ozpin back.

178
00:12:26,717 --> 00:12:30,508
谢谢你 先生 我是说 呃 将军
Thank you, sir... I mean, uh, General...

179
00:12:31,050 --> 00:12:32,175
埃隆伍德将军?
Uh, Ironwood?

180
00:12:46,342 --> 00:12:48,217
你要把它还给我?
You're giving it back to me?

181
00:12:49,258 --> 00:12:51,258
经过金牌特工的那些事
After what happened with the Ace-Ops,

182
00:12:51,300 --> 00:12:53,592
我不想让你觉得我有在向你隐瞒任何事情
I don't want you to think I'm keeping anything from you.

183
00:12:53,633 --> 00:12:56,258
尤其是像这那么重要的物品
Especially something as important as this.

184
00:12:57,175 --> 00:13:00,300
眼下 我觉得它在把它带来的人手里最安全
For the time being, I think it's safest with the people who brought it here.

185
00:13:02,217 --> 00:13:04,050
谢谢你
Um... thank you.

186
00:13:08,883 --> 00:13:12,592
想要打赢塞伦 我们必须合作
We must work together if we're to fight Salem and win.

187
00:13:14,633 --> 00:13:17,050
那么 如果你们都同意的话
Now, if you're all on board...

188
00:13:22,675 --> 00:13:24,008
告诉我们该怎么帮忙
Tell us how we can help.

189
00:13:25,925 --> 00:13:28,800
很好 因为要让阿米特通讯塔准备好运作
Good, because getting the Amity Tower ready to launch

190
00:13:28,883 --> 00:13:29,675
没那么容易
won't be easy.

191
00:13:30,508 --> 00:13:31,717
但首先
But first,

192
00:13:32,342 --> 00:13:34,550
我觉得我们得确保你们的武器
I think we need to get those weapons of yours,

193
00:13:35,050 --> 00:13:36,675
能达到我们的标准
up to our standards.

194
00:13:39,133 --> 00:13:41,300
记住 这里可是擎天
Remember, this is Atlas.

195
00:13:41,342 --> 00:13:43,050
当与军队合作之时
While assisting the military,

196
00:13:43,092 --> 00:13:47,050
我们会向你提供 军方科学家能制造的最好的装备
we will provide you with the best equipment our scientists can devise.

197
00:13:47,633 --> 00:13:48,800
耶!
Yeah!

198
00:13:48,842 --> 00:13:51,342
所以那是我第二次被禁闭
So that was the second time I got banned.

199
00:13:51,383 --> 00:13:52,925
而第三次是在
Then there was the third time when --

200
00:13:52,967 --> 00:13:54,342
好了不聊了
All right, cut the chatter.

201
00:13:56,842 --> 00:14:00,258
我为在曼特城的误会诚挚道歉
I'd like to sincerely apologize for the miscommunication down in Mantle,

202
00:14:00,300 --> 00:14:01,175
我们不是故意
we didn't intend to --

203
00:14:01,217 --> 00:14:02,800
我真的感到很愧疚!
I feel so bad, honestly!

204
00:14:02,842 --> 00:14:04,425
如果我们当时知道你们是谁
If we had known who you were we'd be

205
00:14:04,467 --> 00:14:06,342
现在肯定已经一起谈笑风生--
laughing over a hot meal right now and-

206
00:14:06,383 --> 00:14:09,550
我明自 你们只是服从命令!
I understand, you were just following orders!

207
00:14:09,592 --> 00:14:12,383
我说 你们本可以先问几个问题再动手
I mean you could have asked us some questions first.

208
00:14:13,717 --> 00:14:17,717
询问只对弱者 但我们现在是一伙的了!
Questions are for the weak, but we're all on the same team now!

209
00:14:17,758 --> 00:14:19,258
并不是说我对此感到开心
Not that I'm happy about it.

210
00:14:23,842 --> 00:14:25,592
我们只是想道个歉
We just wanted to say we're sorry.

211
00:14:25,842 --> 00:14:28,592
而且我们很期待在下一次任务与你们合作
And that we're looking forward to working with you on our next mission.

212
00:14:29,092 --> 00:14:32,592
你们虽然只是学生 但你们已经像我们一样努力战斗了
You might be students, but you've been fighting just as hard as we have.

213
00:14:32,967 --> 00:14:33,842
甚至战得更艰难
If not, harder.

214
00:14:34,258 --> 00:14:37,258
所以我很期待你们这些孩子有多厉害哦
Exactly why I'm looking forward to seeing what you kids can do.

215
00:14:37,300 --> 00:14:40,883
不要啥事都比个高下啊 你这兔子
Ugh, not everything's a competition Hare.

216
00:14:42,342 --> 00:14:44,800
来吧 让我带你们到校园里转转
C'mon, let me show you around campus.

217
00:14:48,425 --> 00:14:48,883
克罗
Qrow.

218
00:14:56,092 --> 00:14:58,133
我是真心觉得 很高兴能再次见到你
I meant it when I said it was good to see you again.

219
00:15:00,008 --> 00:15:02,883
你也是
Uh, yeah, you too.

220
00:15:14,883 --> 00:15:16,758
那么这里是餐厅
So that way's the cafeteria,

221
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:19,008
那里是训练室
and that way is the training rooms, oh,

222
00:15:19,050 --> 00:15:21,467
那边是教室!
and over there are the classrooms!

223
00:15:23,342 --> 00:15:25,633
这些地方看起来都很棒 Penny
This all looks great, Penny.

224
00:15:25,675 --> 00:15:27,675
但我们住哪呢
But where are we staying?

225
00:15:27,717 --> 00:15:29,967
记住 你们在擎天
Remember, you're in Atlas now!

226
00:15:30,008 --> 00:15:32,550
作为树不子最有钱的学校
As the most well-funded school on Remnant,

227
00:15:32,592 --> 00:15:35,425
每个队伍都有自己的房间!
every team at Atlas Academy gets their own room!

228
00:15:35,467 --> 00:15:36,592
如果这还不够
And if that wasn't enough --

229
00:15:36,633 --> 00:15:38,133
所以我们住宿舍吗?
So we're staying in the dorms?

230
00:15:39,467 --> 00:15:41,300
就像在信标学院一样!
It'll be just like Beacon again!

231
00:15:56,883 --> 00:16:01,633
擎天王国会继续强大并继续安全
[Radio] The kingdom of Atlas will remain strong and it will remain safe.

232
00:16:02,050 --> 00:16:04,800
这是我的承诺
That is my promise.

233
00:16:12,883 --> 00:16:17,592
我说最后一遍 单个的藏身处会让我们更容易被发现
For the last time, a singular hideout makes us more susceptible to discovery.

234
00:16:17,633 --> 00:16:18,967
但如果我们被看见
But what if we're seen?

235
00:16:19,133 --> 00:16:20,300
如果我们被认出
What if we're recognized?

236
00:16:20,342 --> 00:16:22,675
我们保持机动
We stay mobile.

237
00:16:23,592 --> 00:16:27,258
我们在一个有无数监控的城市里走动
We're walking around a city with a thousand eyes.

238
00:16:28,217 --> 00:16:31,258
虽然擎天的网络安保系统被加强了
While cyber security has been stepped up in Atlas,

239
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:35,050
但和以往一样 曼特城的就没升级
as usual, none of the code was updated in Mantle.

240
00:16:40,467 --> 00:16:42,842
那听起来可真有用
That certainly sounds useful.

241
00:16:44,925 --> 00:16:49,342
那当然 毕竟我还为这些代码贡献过一分力
It should be, I helped write that code after all.

242
00:16:58,008 --> 00:17:03,050
我想 人各有所长嘛
Ah, well, I suppose we all have our talents.